{
  "declaredLength": 2456,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "我忘在家里了吗……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115FD857285BB691CC4E86541720262026001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n我有件事想请你帮忙。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A621167094EF64E8B60F38BF74F605E2E5FD93002001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不……没事了。\n我去找安馨儿商量吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D202620266CA14E8B4E863002000A621153BB627E5B8999A8513F554691CF54273002001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "安馨儿，\n我有件事想拜托胡帕。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B8999A8513FFF0C000A621167094EF64E8B60F362DC625880E15E153002001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不行哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D884C54E6300200100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咦？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54A6FF1F001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "忘了东西就让胡帕去取，\n这太滑头了，所以不行。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5FD84E864E1C897F5C318BA980E15E1553BB53D6FF0C000A8FD9592A6ED159344E86FF0C62404EE54E0D884C300200100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不是吧……\n你不也是……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D662F542720262026000A4F604E0D4E5F662F20262026001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我之所以拜托胡帕\n带我移动到这个旅馆，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n是因为我不想让大家有不必要的担心。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E4B62404EE562DC625880E15E15000A5E26621179FB52A852308FD94E2A65C59986FF0C00100001BE00000A662F56E04E3A62114E0D60F38BA959275BB667094E0D5FC58981768462C55FC3300200100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且我母亲也说过\n懒惰是不对的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E1462116BCD4EB24E5F8BF48FC7000A61D260F0662F4E0D5BF97684300200100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我可能的确有点\n依赖<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>他们了……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621153EF80FD7684786E670970B9000A4F9D8D5600100002010000004ED64EEC4E8620262026001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好吧！\n自己的事自己做！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D5427FF01000A81EA5DF176844E8B81EA5DF1505AFF01001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了卯足干劲，<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>！\n和我认真地打一场对战吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E86536F8DB35E7252B2FF0C0010000201000000FF01000A548C62118BA4771F573062534E00573A5BF962185427FF01001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那我就在院子里等你了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A362115C31572896625B5091CC7B494F604E863002001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我们也去参观一下\n琵鲁认真起来的样子吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EEC4E5F53BB53C289C24E004E0B000A74359C818BA4771F8D776765768468375B505427FF0100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "噼帕帕！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "567C5E155E15FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n请你和我来场动真格的对战！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A8BF74F60548C62116765573A52A8771F683C76845BF96218FF01001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好啊！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D554AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "输赢当然也很重要，\n我还要看看自己能认真到什么地步。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8F938D625F5371364E5F5F8891CD8981FF0C000A62118FD88981770B770B81EA5DF180FD8BA4771F52304EC04E4857306B653002001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "面对密阿雷最强的训练家，\n我能打到什么程度呢……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n检验自己的时候到了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "97625BF95BC6963F96F767005F3A76848BAD7EC35BB6FF0C000A621180FD625352304EC04E487A0B5EA654622026202600100001BE00000A68C09A8C81EA5DF1768465F6501952304E86FF01001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我好想见识一下\n头巾混混有多强！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211597D60F389C18BC64E004E0B000A59345DFE6DF76DF76709591A5F3AFF0100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "噼帕帕！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "567C5E155E15FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "头巾混混！你总是会帮我的忙！\n这次轮到我来让你大放异彩了！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59345DFE6DF76DF7FF014F60603B662F4F1A5E2E621176845FD9FF01000A8FD96B218F6E5230621167658BA94F605927653E5F025F694E86FF01FF01001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "果然厉害！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n不过，能和<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>打动真格的对战，\n我也很厉害对吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "679C713653895BB3FF0100100001BE01000A4E0D8FC7FF0C80FD548C0010000201000000625352A8771F683C76845BF96218FF0C000A62114E5F5F8853895BB35BF95427FF1F001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "没错！<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>和琵鲁！\n你们两位都很厉害！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CA19519FF010010000201000000548C74359C81FF01000A4F604EEC4E244F4D90FD5F8853895BB3FF0100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你明明那么厉害，\n为什么不能说回家就回家呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60660E660E90A34E4853895BB3FF0C000A4E3A4EC04E484E0D80FD8BF456DE5BB65C3156DE5BB65462FF1F00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我倒是很想见我妹妹，\n但因为不想和我奶奶照面……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115012662F5F8860F389C1621159B959B9FF0C000A4F4656E04E3A4E0D60F3548C6211597659767167976220262026001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "抱歉！你妈妈都不在你身边，\n和你相比，我也太任性了对吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62B16B49FF014F605988598890FD4E0D57284F608EAB8FB9FF0C000A548C4F6076F86BD4FF0C62114E5F592A4EFB60274E865BF95427FF1F001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我觉得即便是自己的祖母，\n不想见的话，不见就好了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621189C95F9753734FBF662F81EA5DF1768479566BCDFF0C000A4E0D60F389C176848BDDFF0C4E0D89C15C31597D4E86300200100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咦？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54A6FF1F001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊没什么，你的意见让我有点意外而已。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554A6CA14EC04E48FF0C4F607684610F89C18BA96211670970B9610F5916800C5DF23002001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "与其做不想做的事，\n不如把时间用于打磨自己。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0E5176505A4E0D60F3505A76844E8BFF0C000A4E0D5982628A65F695F475284E8E625378E881EA5DF1300200100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "然后能获得对方认可的话就赚到了。\n就算不能也不会有损失！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7136540E80FD83B75F975BF965B98BA453EF76848BDD5C318D5A52304E863002000A5C317B974E0D80FD4E5F4E0D4F1A6709635F5931FF0100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗞嗞～",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 1988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55DE55DEFF5E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看来头巾混混\n也赞成安馨儿的意见啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 1996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B676559345DFE6DF76DF7000A4E5F8D5E62105B8999A8513F7684610F89C1554A3002001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我会先让我妹妹更开心的。\n毕竟我奶奶一直很溺爱她。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114F1A51488BA9621159B959B966F45F005FC376843002000A6BD57ADF6211597659764E0076F45F886EBA723159793002001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那我也做些特别的甜甜圈，\n让你妹妹更高兴吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A362114E5F505A4E9B7279522B7684751C751C5708FF0C000A8BA94F6059B959B966F49AD851745427FF0100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就像这样一点一滴地\n改变你祖母的心意吧！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C3150CF8FD968374E0070B94E006EF45730000A653953D84F6079566BCD76845FC3610F5427FF01FF0100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗞嗞～",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55DE55DEFF5E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "以我的才能，\n哪怕是我奶奶的想法也能改变！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n而她如果能认可我的话，\n我就不用讨厌她了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EE562117684624D80FDFF0C000A54EA6015662F621159765976768460F36CD54E5F80FD653953D8FF0100100001BE01000A800C59795982679C80FD8BA453EF621176848BDDFF0C000A62115C314E0D75288BA8538C59794E863002001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "和<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>对战\n让我重拾了自信！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "548C00100002010000005BF96218000A8BA9621191CD62FE4E8681EA4FE1FF01001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我会对此心存感激，\n同时为了我妹妹和大家，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n追逐梦想，勇往直前！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
